---

AGPL-3.0 was chosen for NetCert because:

1. It ensures that improvements to the platform (including network-accessible
   modifications, e.g. a hosted instance) must contribute back to the community.
2. It aligns with the "free forever" commitment — no one can take the code
   private, close the platform, and charge for it without contributing changes.
3. It protects against SaaS-ification without reciprocity.

For questions about licensing, open an issue or contact the maintainers.
